<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - General Dynamics cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - General Dynamics cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said Friday it downgraded  General Dynamics Corp.</p>
<p>-- Office of analyst Byron Callan said actions were based on price.</p>
<p>-- Cut near-term rating to neutral from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Cut long-term rating to accumulate from buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 15/16 to 87-9/16.</p>
</text>
